:"https://github.com/nielsbuus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/42048329","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/10444#issuecomment-42048329","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/10444","id":42048329,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyMDQ4MzI5","user":{"login":"rafaelfranca","id":47848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca","html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelfranca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-05-02T16:07:50Z","updated_at":"2014-05-02T16:07:50Z","body":"I think this behavior is correct and it is how ruby works. The block run in the context of the `menu` view not in the context of the `show` view. This is why it get the `menu` scope.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/42048329/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"rafaelfranca","id":47848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca","html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelfranca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":117358832,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTE3MzU4ODMy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/events/117358832","actor":{"login":"rafaelfranca","id":47848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca","html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelfranca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelfranca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"closed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2014-05-02T16:07:50Z","state_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/42056724","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/10444#issuecomment-42056724","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/10444","id":42056724,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyMDU2NzI0","user":{"login":"nielsbuus","id":3750087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTAwODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3750087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus","html_url":"https://github.com/nielsbuus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-05-02T17:29:08Z","updated_at":"2014-05-02T17:35:15Z","body":"I have examined the issue now and I think I agree. I think the cause of the confusion can be illustrated here:\n\n```\nclass Foo\n  @virtual_path = \"foo\"\n  class << self\n\n    def execute_block(&block)\n      block.call\n    end\n\n    def t(key)\n      \"#{@virtual_path}#{key}\"\n    end\n\n  end\nend\n\nclass Bar\n  @virtual_path = \"bar\"\n  class << self\n\n    def call_foo\n      Foo.execute_block do\n        t('.menu')\n      end\n    end\n\n    def t(key)\n      \"#{@virtual_path}#{key}\"\n    end\n\n  end\nend\n\nputs Bar.call_foo\n=> \"bar.menu\"\n```\n\nAnd thus, if you think of your views as seperate objects, it's very peculiar that @alexisbernards example behaves differently.\n\nHowever, in Rails all views are, AFAIK, rendered in the same object.\n\nSo to fit the above example into Rails, it would look like this:\n\n```\nclass Rails\n  @virtual_path = nil\n  class << self\n\n    def render_source\n      @virtual_path = \"source\"\n      execute_block do\n        t('.menu')\n      end\n    end\n\n    def execute_block(&block)\n      @virtual_path = \"destination\"\n      block.call\n    end\n\n    def t(key)\n      \"#{@virtual_path}#{key}\"\n    end\n\n  end\nend\n\nputs Rails.render_source\n=> \"destination.menu\"\n```\n\nThe mistake here is postponing the evaluation of the block until rendering the destination partial.\n\nIf you want to use the calling partial as the scope, you can evaluate the block immediately. So to rewrite @alexisbernards helper, it would look like this:\n\n```\nmodule UsersHelper\n  def users_menu(&block)\n    block_value_evaluated_while_virtual_path_is_index = block.call\n    render(\"menu\", some_html_string: block_value_evaluated_while_virtual_path_is_index)\n  end\nend\n```\n\nAnd inside the `show` method, it would just read as\n\n```\n<%= some_html_string %>\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/42056724/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nielsbuus","id":3750087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTAwODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3750087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus","html_url":"https://github.com/nielsbuus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbuus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}}]